 "id": "digieq",
 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "Digi EQ",
 "description": "A master tone tilt: the output split into low and high bands, each with its own gain. A fixed gentle upward tilt by default (DIGIEQ_LOW_D / DIGIEQ_HIGH_D); the knobbed 4-band page reuses this kernel. Combines with every mod.",
